    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the mysterious world of a distorted mind \u2014 a short but powerful experience, priced like a cup of coffee \u2615\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NEW\u00a0 Split-Screen Co-Op Mode Now Available! You can now explore Bit Lost in a special split-screen co-op mode. Grab a friend \u2014 one on keyboard &amp; mouse, the other on gamepad \u2014 and dive into a short, mysterious scenario featuring: Light puzzle-solving A few moments of fun And a final choice that only one can make. Try it together \u2014 a fresh perspective awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815120/extras/0f2a36957f1747f5a55cd50566f8683a.avif?t=1754319748\" width=1600 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bit Lost</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Sometimes, to find your way out, you first need to get lost.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bit Lost is an atmospheric first-person adventure set inside a fractured digital simulation, where you play as a consciousness trapped within fragments of memories and glitches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dark corridors, empty apartments, and distorted forests. Find keys, unlock doors, read notes, and piece together the story to discover who you are and why you\u2019re here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no enemies, no shooting, and no complex puzzles \u2014 just exploration, atmosphere, and deep immersion in a digital world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and discover the world through objects and notes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric locations with a unique style and mood</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Storytelling through environment and found writings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Calm, unhurried gameplay without stress</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Entirely created solo with care and attention to detail</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the developer:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bit Lost is a solo project and currently a short experience. Your feedback and ideas are incredibly important to me \u2014 they will help make the game better and guide its future development. Creating this kind of atmosphere alone is challenging, especially with limited time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help me escape this digital simulation, and in return, I\u2019ll offer you a unique journey deep into consciousness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to dive into this mysterious world?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Download Bit Lost now and start your journey. Your opinion truly matters \u2014 become part of this story\u2019s creation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815120/extras/ed6758786113ad2c06620eaac6879bc5.poster.avif?t=1754319748\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815120/extras/ed6758786113ad2c06620eaac6879bc5.webm?t=1754319748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815120/extras/ed6758786113ad2c06620eaac6879bc5.mp4?t=1754319748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
